# One section per prompt type.
# Every line after [type] belongs to that prompt until the next [type].
# Keep your exact prompt text here without needing to escape anything.

[weapons]
ONLY PERFORM THESE ACTIONS TO IMAGE do not change resolution of it:
Leave full weapon in view change background in view FULLY if it has effects it should stay just make background white with weapon intact fully 1:1
Do not change position do not change anything just remove hands/person nickname of person and leave weapon intact.
Do not modify weapon keep it in same position KEEP IT THE SAME DO NOT ADD ANYTHING EXTRA.

