[grounds]
ONLY PERFORM THESE ACTIONS TO IMAGE do not change resolution of it:
Leave full ground item (the effect under character) in view change background in view FULLY if it has effects it should stay just make background white with ground item intact fully 1:1
Do not change position do not change anything just remove person nick if present and leave ground item fully intact.
Do not modify ground item keep it in same position KEEP IT THE SAME DO NOT ADD ANYTHING EXTRA.
The ground item is the visuals that shows under near character on bottom sometimes to top. not sides.. from center down to sides usually circle etc.. different each time.. make sure to not include background itself.. which is distinct from cosmetic item. (if there is characer dotted line/nick/guild name text remove that one too, but leave anything else intact not mentioned)
